            "description": {
              "value": "Your sneak attack slices through the threads binding magic to a target. Make a Strike against a flat-footed creature (your choice). If your Strike deals sneak attack damage, you attempt to counteract a single spell active on the target. Your counteract level is equal to half your level (rounded up), and your counteract check modifier is equal to your class DC – 10."
